komi, often pulling the brakes when things get too crazy or out of hand."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Like Tamane and Yakumo, Ryouta is not part of the any club and instead, just helps out part-timely at Seamore just like his other siblings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He doesn't understand that his sisters are all in love with him and just shakes off the whole thing as \"family love\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38571"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/87f1b12a128dd4eaf05ab2c36d3cea7139325559f076ee326d1cd6236ce2f478.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d9d52512fbc33de43f6f98eefb9ccb261a346e835d09b3a9dd75417a1db04af8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c40529","characterName":"間宮 小次郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c40529"},"originalCharacterName":"間宮 小次郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"621"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"What he calls the protagonist: Ryouta"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The quintuplets' father. He loves spoiling his daughters, though they see their father as kind of annoying. He loves his wife wholeheartedly and rarely gets into any fights with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kojirou is a master at cooking and works as the head chef of Seamore, while teaching Tamane everything he knows about cooking. At times, he goes on journeys to do some research about all kinds of cooking styles and so on. It's become such a normal thing in the family that nobody is surprised even when Kojirou disappears somewhere, only to come back from a journey..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40529"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e41039513059d2ad10af9ac7a48afccbf9ade52b6c3efc25815b8f58dbf434d3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f4707a5a295500191b75d3bc2f3f9656e1a2dee4b0e64e828be9e3ee25d7bdb.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"秋月 秀行","creatorId":"vndb:s8198","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8198","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8198","name":"梅津 秀行","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:65915","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c40530","characterName":"間宮 陽菜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c40530"},"originalCharacterName":"間宮 陽菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"510"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"What she calls the protagonist: Ryou-chan"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The quintuplets' mother who has a kind personality. She is always seen with a smile on her face, and is a good wife as well. Haruna supports her husband from the shadows by taking up the role as Seamore's manager."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of her young appearance, she is often though to be the quintuplets' older sister instead of mother. Haruna loves her children very much and is always giving the girls consultation - whether it be about love or other matters."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40530"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d45d9217b2815edc3059828f8c0bf2996fbe9c46ec7e7d6942f9bece5c1a38ab.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c6eb0e51b54e26c0a445eb1446c19943858ed0a0fb018bbb479554015a51279.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"六番街 マリ","creatorId":"vndb:s9178","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9178","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9178","name":"六番街 マリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:65918","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c40531","characterName":"間宮 京花","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c40531"},"originalCharacterName":"間宮 京花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1005"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"92"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"What she calls the protagonist: Ryouta-kun"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The gentle older cousin, an English teacher and the homeroom teacher of Ryouta's class. She also helps managing the lost & found service at the school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kyouka takes her job seriously and has a honest personality, which has made her popular with both her students and coworkers. She takes her students into consideration, and is especially concerned of Ririka who has a hard time making friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kyouka loves Ryouta more than anything and tries her best to show her appeal to him. She even wants to marry him (since it's okay to get married to your cousin) and has even received approval from her own parents. Especially lately Kyouka has been keeping her eyes open for all possible chances."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40531"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff5c5af17184ceb8dc36a608c2b5b6c6f557a926b607a1f542898270ec608593.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dce110af754e760a4be38a5d1e7c3ebdc33a3b0919ab3a2e7754cde4dbef732a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"森谷 こころ","creatorId":"vndb:s3660","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3660","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3660","name":"佐々木 未来","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:65917","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c40532","characterName":"白井 六兵衛","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c40532"},"originalCharacterName":"白井 六兵衛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"720"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"What he calls the protagonist: Ryouta"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ryouta's best friend and classmate. He is also friends with his sisters. He is very passionate about his hobby, watching gravure idol videos, which he can talk a lot about. Even though he often teases Ryouta, Rokubee is a reliable friend w